modifier.catcher_changed.name=Catcher
modifier.catcher_changed.desc=§oGotta catch 'em all!§r\nCatch Mobs and stores it when killed it... and release it!
modifier.analysing_changed.name=Analysing
modifier.analysing_changed.desc=§oI know what you are!§r\nLess drops but more? experience!
modifier.congenial_changed.name=Congenial
modifier.congenial_changed.desc=§oYou are my rival!§r\nAlready known enemies take more damage,and reduce almost all damage to unknown enemies.
modifier.arcane_changed.name=Arcane
modifier.arcane_changed.desc=§oLet's go out! It's dark!§r\nNighttime is good for the tool health.
modifier.blind_changed.name=Blind
modifier.blind_changed.desc=§oIt's a dark night, I can't even see!§r\nDarkness brings weakness and also more darkness.And also bring darkness at day.
modifier.bright_changed.name=Bright
modifier.bright_changed.desc=§oIt's a bright day, I feel strong!§r\nDaytime let you glow, and increase your strength.
modifier.cascade_changed.name=Cascade
modifier.cascade_changed.desc=§oThrough the walls!§r\nBreaks blocks will cause random damage to other block.
modifier.curvature_changed.name=Curvature
modifier.curvature_changed.desc=§oIt pulls me!§r\nSometimes it teleports you or your surroundings,or help you teleports no randomly.
modifier.dark_changed.name=Dark
modifier.dark_changed.desc=§oIt's dark outside, let's fight!§r\nNighttime makes you stronger.
modifier.diffuse_changed.name=Diffuse
modifier.diffuse_changed.desc=§oThere is much to learn!§r\nRegular blocks drop exp(Sure?), but loot is probably gone.
modifier.dissolving_changed.name=Dissolving
modifier.dissolving_changed.desc=§oThis seems a lot.§r\nSometimes there is no experience and then a huge amount.
modifier.fracture_changed.name=Fracture
modifier.fracture_changed.desc=§oRupture!§r\nBreaks blocks in a straight line.
modifier.fracture_fixed.name=Fracture
modifier.fracture_fixed.desc=§oRupture!§r\nBreaks random length of blocks in a straight line.
modifier.fragile_changed.name=Fragile
modifier.fragile_changed.desc=§oEarthquake§r\nUse more durability to weaken block you harvested.
modifier.fragile_fixed.name=Fragile
modifier.fragile_fixed.desc=§oEarthquake§r\nUse more durability to weaken block you harvested.
modifier.garishly_changed.name=Garishly
modifier.garishly_changed.desc=§oIt's so hot.§r\nThey actually drop fiery stuff.
modifier.garishly_fixed.name=Garishly
modifier.garishly_fixed.desc=§oIt's so hot.§r\nThey actually drop fiery stuff,However it will destroy items during harvest.
modifier.glimmer_changed.name=Glimmer
modifier.glimmer_changed.desc=§oNo darkness for me!§r\nSometimes you get night vision and glowing.
modifier.heroic_changed.name=Heroic
modifier.heroic_changed.desc=§oNever give up!§r\nWhen your or this tool's life is go to the end,you will have higher attack damage.
modifier.hollow_changed.name=Hollow
modifier.hollow_changed.desc=§oBraindead!§r\nMakes your enemies brainless.\nBecause that they are too stupid now,so they even will forgot to give your reward.
modifier.unstable_changed.name=Unstable
modifier.unstable_changed.desc=§oCan you feel this?§r\nSeriously, this is completely unstable! Expect explosions!
modifier.naturebound_changed.name=Naturebound
modifier.naturebound_changed.desc=§oYou are one with your surrounding!§r\nRepairs the tool when you are close to plants.
modifier.pulverizing_changed.name=Pulverizing
modifier.pulverizing_changed.desc=§oAntimatter?§r\nLose all drops,and dig much faster.
modifier.pulverizing_fixed.name=Pulverizing
modifier.pulverizing_fixed.desc=§oAntimatter?§r\nLose most drops,and dig much faster.
modifier.resonance_changed.name=Resonance
modifier.resonance_changed.desc=§oFeel the vibrations!§r\nEnemies propably fly away after a hit!
modifier.slaughtering_changed.name=Slaughtering
modifier.slaughtering_changed.desc=§oYum yum!§r\nWho needs EXP if you can have a lot more meat?
modifier.softy_changed.name=Softy
modifier.softy_changed.desc=§oI love dirt!§r\nDirt digging heals!(Compare to rocks...)
modifier.uncertain_changed.name=Uncertain
modifier.uncertain_changed.desc=§oSome kind of risky to use.§r\nAt least it's not unstable...or?
modifier.reviving_changed.name=Reviving
modifier.reviving_changed.desc=§oPlease kill it already!§r\nThey are undead?!
modifier.melting_changed.name=Melting
modifier.melting_changed.desc=§oSo damn hot!§r\nMelts down blocks to lava!
modifier.cursed_changed.name=Cursed
modifier.cursed_changed.desc=§oI don't feel well!§r\nThe more time you hold it, the more there is a chance for random hurt.
modifier.superheavy_changed.name=Super Heavy
modifier.superheavy_changed.desc=§oIt weights over 9000!§r\nAs you dig a lot, it will make you tired.
modifier.whirl_changed.name=Whirl
modifier.whirl_changed.desc=§oLike a sponge!§r\nRemove water at a gained radius.
modifier.souleater_fixed.name=Souleater
modifier.souleater_fixed.desc=§oCan I call it "foodie"？§r\nThe attack damage will increase after kill enemy,However, the rate of increasing is decreased against damage.
modifier.souleater_changed.name=Souleater
modifier.souleater_changed.desc=§oCan I call it "foodie"？§r\nThe attack damage will increase after kill enemy.
modifier.berserk_changed.name=BERSERK
modifier.berserk_changed.desc=§oI'm angry now!§r\nActive it to get three times faster and stronger,and cost much durability...
modifier.tantrum_changed.name=Tantrum
modifier.tantrum_changed.desc=§oCast an explosion!§r\nThis tool can store explosion in it,and active it to release.
modifier.decay_changed.name=Decay
modifier.decay_changed.desc=§oRadioactive!§r\nYour tool is fading away over time.
modifier.ported_changed.name=Ported
modifier.ported_changed.desc=§oBeam me up!§r\nTeleport you up when you active this tool.
modifier.crushing_changed.name=Crushing
modifier.crushing_changed.desc=§oWhat?Where's my stone,F*****！§r\nChance to drop sand, gravel cobblestone or stone when mining stone.
modifier.mutate_changed.name=Mutate
modifier.mutate_changed.desc=§oBeta-ray？§r\nChange the block of you want dig to low value blocks.
modifier.leveled.name=Leveled
modifier.leveled.desc=WIP
